1
00:00:30,000 --> 00:00:36,000
Ambition is a science fiction, history, mystery film directed by Tomek Bagiński.

2
00:01:00,000 --> 00:01:06,000
A young apprentice struggles to master nanotechnology on an alien
world and prove herself to her enigmatic master.

3
00:01:30,000 --> 00:01:36,000
Will her herculean goals remain tantalizingly out of reach, or will she
fulfill them and in the process, change life as we know it?

4
00:02:00,000 --> 00:02:06,000
Master, played by Aidan Gillen.

5
00:02:30,000 --> 00:02:36,000
Apprentice, played by Aisling Franciosi.

6
00:03:00,000 --> 00:03:06,000
Naked Ambition 2, also known as 3D Naked Ambition (Chinese: 3D豪情), is a 2014 Hong Kong 3D sex
comedy film directed by Lee Kung-lok and starring Chapman To and Josie Ho.

7
00:03:30,000 --> 00:03:36,000
It is a loose sequel to Chan Hing-ka and Dante Lam's 2003 film Naked Ambition.

8
00:04:00,000 --> 00:04:06,000
Filming began in Tokyo in October 2013.

9
00:04:30,000 --> 00:04:36,000
The film parodies the Japanese adult film industry through
various iconic scenes with exaggerated expressions.

10
00:05:00,000 --> 00:05:06,000
The film explores themes of mind control, future,
apprentice, telekinesis, space.

11
00:05:30,000 --> 00:05:36,000
The tone is thought_provoking and mind_bending.
